Nightdrive: a grouped window's tabs (groupbar) get the windows' drop shadow

The drop shadow is drawn around the window only: the groupbar is a decoration of its own, drawn over the
window, so its tabs had none (Nightdrive #3731). The window's shadow decoration now also draws one under each
tab, with decoration:shadow's values and the tabs' rounding, before the window and the groupbar are drawn.
Not upstream; carried until Hyprland has an option for it.
---
